                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-4xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                        🥗
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Filtros de Dieta</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
